OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe use of firearm after
OL,4,Aman found dead in Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the use of a
OL,7,Ffirearm after a man was found dead in
OL,8,FWest Lothian.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports of an injured person in a house
OL,12,Fon Harestanes Road, Armadale, at about
OL,13,F11:50 on Saturday. A 35-year-old man
OL,14,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland said inquiries were at
OL,17,Fan early stage and a post-mortem
OL,18,Fexamination would take place, but one
OL,19,Fline of inquiry is that a firearm may
OL,20,Fhave been used.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
